#. module: om_account_pdc
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:om_account_pdc.action_account_pdc_issue
msgid ""
"Register the cheque with the bills it pays: they are settled at once, and the cheque waits on the\n"
"                PDC account until it is cleared from the bank on its date."
msgstr "Registra l'assegno con le fatture fornitore che paga: vengono saldate subito, e l'assegno resta sul\n                conto PDC finché non viene addebitato in banca alla sua data."

#. module: om_account_pdc
#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:om_account_pdc.action_account_pdc_receive
msgid ""
"Register the cheque with the invoices it pays: they are settled at once, and the cheque waits on the\n"
"                PDC account until you clear it into the bank on its date."
msgstr "Registra l'assegno con le fatture che paga: vengono saldate subito, e l'assegno resta sul\n                conto PDC finché non lo incassi in banca alla sua data."

#. module: om_account_pdc
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_om_account_pdc
msgid ""
"Register the post-dated cheques received from customers and issued to "
"vendors, settle their invoices at once, deposit them, clear them into the "
"bank on their date and handle the bounced ones."
msgstr "Registra gli assegni postdatati ricevuti dai clienti ed emessi ai fornitori, salda subito le loro fatture, versali, incassali in banca alla loro data e gestisci quelli insoluti."

